            <section id="bio">
                <h1>Aaron Grando</h1>
                <h2>I build things: prototypes, products, platforms.</h2>
                <p>
                    Hey, I'm Aaron. I turn AI ideas into useful products, build the platforms behind them, and lead the work that gets teams using them.
                    <br />
                    <br />
                    I've helped turn scattered experiments with generative AI into something an organization can actually use: a governed internal platform that gives agents the right context and gives people one place to use them. And to keep enabling innovation, I deployed processes that turn experiments into measurable prototypes and, if proven out, production-level capabilities, learning what works before investing the resources that real deployments actually need. That work reached clients too. I spent more than 15 years translating new technology ideas into terms clients can understand and act on at one of the most creative agencies in the country.
                    <br />
                    <br />
                    Today, I'm most at home where product strategy and platform architecture overlap: talking with people, figuring out what's worth building, and helping make it real.
                </p>
                <p id="availability">
                    <span class="looking">I'm looking for my next full-time role: a worthwhile challenge in applied AI product leadership.</span>
                    <strong>Open to: </strong><br />VP / Head of Product &nbsp;·&nbsp; AI Product &amp; Platform &nbsp;·&nbsp; Creative&nbsp;Technology
                </p>
